stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT: import (processes:deploy) or new draft (processes:author)
  DRAFT --> DRAFT: edit, validate (If-Match)
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: request-approval, zero validation errors
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT: reject with reason
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> ACTIVE: approve by another identity
  DRAFT --> ACTIVE: dev profile auto-approve only
  ACTIVE --> RETIRED: newer version effective, or retire with reason (last version needs confirmation)
  DRAFT --> RETIRED: withdraw
  RETIRED --> [*]
  classDef engine fill:#E0F2F1,stroke:#00796B,stroke-width:2px,color:#16231F
  classDef client fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#16231F
  classDef obs fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,color:#16231F
  class DRAFT,PENDING_APPROVAL client
  class ACTIVE engine
  class RETIRED obs
